<%- include('partials/public-header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Your AI commerce assistant for chat-first selling</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    Tovila replies to customers instantly, captures orders accurately, and
    knows when to bring you in — so you stop typing the same answers over
    and over and start closing more sales.
  </p>
  <a href="/login" class="btn-primary">Log in</a>
</section>

<section class="feature-grid" id="features">
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>Replies in the customer's own words</h3>
    <p>English, Swahili, Sheng, or a natural mix — Tovila replies in whichever language the customer used, instantly, 24/7.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>Order capture &amp; tracking</h3>
    <p>Every order gets recorded automatically — item, quantity, delivery location, customer details — with a status you update as you fulfill it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>Knows when to bring you in</h3>
    <p>Complaints, custom pricing requests, or genuine uncertainty get flagged to you directly, with a notification — Tovila never guesses on your behalf.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>A real dashboard, not spreadsheets</h3>
    <p>See what needs your attention, orders to prepare, and real reporting on conversations, response time, and sales activity — all in one place.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="steps" id="how-it-works">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">1</div>
      <h3>Connect your number</h3>
      <p>Link the WhatsApp number your customers already message.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">2</div>
      <h3>Add your catalog &amp; FAQs</h3>
      <p>Products, prices, delivery fees, and common questions — Tovila only ever answers from what you give it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">3</div>
      <h3>Let Tovila handle the chats</h3>
      <p>Customers get instant, accurate replies. You get orders ready to fulfill and a heads-up whenever something needs you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="coming-soon">
  <p><strong>Live today:</strong> WhatsApp. <strong>Coming soon:</strong> Instagram and TikTok — the same assistant, wherever your customers message you.</p>
</section>

<%- include('partials/public-footer') %>
